This repository is the monorepo of the Go Lua tooling of tarantool-contrib.
Two of its trees are projects of their own, imported with their history,
each under its license, whose text is in the tree:

  - luascope/ is go-luascope (https://github.com/bigbes/go-luascope),
    BSD 2-Clause License, Copyright (c) 2026, Eugene Blikh; see
    luascope/LICENSE. Its parser is a port of LuaJIT's lexer and parser
    (lj_lex.c, lj_parse.c; MIT License, Copyright (C) 2005-2017 Mike
    Pall, the MIT License text is the one below), and its test corpora
    keep their own licenses: see luascope/parser/testdata/corpus/SOURCES.md.
  - luamerge/ is go-luamerge (https://github.com/tarantool/go-luamerge),
    BSD 2-Clause License, Copyright (c) 2026, Tarantool AUTHORS; see
    luamerge/LICENSE.

