MoonScript v0.8.0 (https://github.com/leafo/moonscript)

The parser, the compiler, the linter, the moon and moonc commands and the
runtime modules (moonscript/, cmd/moon, cmd/moonc) are ports of
MoonScript; moonscript/runtime/moonsrc holds its Lua library sources, and
moonscript/testdata/ holds its specs, spec inputs and outputs and the code
examples of its documentation.

